{
  "file_id": "3545",
  "format": "etdf",
  "kind": "ETDF",
  "text_count": 165,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "Sora, are you okay?",
      "speaker_id": 2621,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19240,
      "_bytes": 19,
      "translation": "Sora, ¿estás bien?"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "Yeah. Somehow.",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19260,
      "_bytes": 14,
      "translation": "Sí. Supongo."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "I'm sorry, Koromon. You're like\nthis because of me...",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19275,
      "_bytes": 53,
      "translation": "Lo siento, Koromon. Estás así\npor mi culpa..."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "Tai, nothing's gonna change if\nyou just wallow in regret.",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19329,
      "_bytes": 60,
      "translation": "Tai, nada cambiará si te\nquedas lamentándote."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "Mimi...",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19390,
      "_bytes": 7,
      "translation": "Mimi..."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "You have to perk up! For Koromon's\nsake, and for yourself!",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19398,
      "_bytes": 58,
      "translation": "¡Anímate! ¡Por Koromon,\ny por ti mismo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "Chosen Children...Chosen\nChildren...!",
      "speaker_id": 5011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19457,
      "_bytes": 37,
      "translation": "Niños Elegidos...¡Niños\nElegidos...!"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "It's Gennai!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19495,
      "_bytes": 12,
      "translation": "¡Es Gennai!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "We got the Tags and Crests like\nyou told us to, but...",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19508,
      "_bytes": 54,
      "translation": "Conseguimos Circuitos y\nEmblemas como dijiste, pero..."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "...we couldn't get our Digimon to\nproperly evolve!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19563,
      "_bytes": 50,
      "translation": "...¡no logramos que los\nDigimon evolucionaran bien!"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "I don't want these Crests!",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19614,
      "_bytes": 26,
      "translation": "¡No quiero estos Emblemas!"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "Calm down, Chosen Children...",
      "speaker_id": 5011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19641,
      "_bytes": 29,
      "translation": "Calmaos, Niños Elegidos..."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "You'll find yourselves with the\nCrests in the end, even if you\ndon't want them.",
      "speaker_id": 5011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19671,
      "_bytes": 79,
      "translation": "Al final os quedaréis con\nlos Emblemas, aunque no\nlos queráis."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "The Tags and Crests are drawn to\neach other, you see.",
      "speaker_id": 5011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19751,
      "_bytes": 53,
      "translation": "Los Circuitos y Emblemas se\natraen entre sí, ya veis."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "No way...",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19805,
      "_bytes": 9,
      "translation": "No puede ser..."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "But...for example, even with the\nCrests and Tags you've obtained...",
      "speaker_id": 5011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19815,
      "_bytes": 67,
      "translation": "Pero...por ejemplo, incluso\ncon los Emblemas y Circuitos\nque tenéis..."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "You'll get more things like the\nGreymon incident if you don't\nraise the Digimon properly.",
      "speaker_id": 5011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19883,
      "_bytes": 89,
      "translation": "Pasarán más cosas como lo\nde Greymon si no cuidáis\nbien a los Digimon."
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "Raise them properly?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19973,
      "_bytes": 20,
      "translation": "¿Cuidarlos bien?"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "Yes. If you don't raise them\nproperly, you can't evolve them\ncorrectly.",
      "speaker_id": 5011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 19994,
      "_bytes": 71,
      "translation": "Sí. Si no los cuidáis bien,\nno evolucionarán\ncorrectamente."
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "But how are we supposed to raise\nthem properly?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20066,
      "_bytes": 47,
      "translation": "¿Pero cómo se supone que\nlos cuidamos bien?"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "Chosen Children, when caring for\nyour Digimon, you should...",
      "speaker_id": 5011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20114,
      "_bytes": 60,
      "translation": "Niños Elegidos, al cuidar de\nvuestros Digimon, debéis..."
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "Gennai! Ugh, that old man's always\nsaying all these confusing things!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20175,
      "_bytes": 69,
      "translation": "¡Gennai! ¡Ese viejo siempre dice\ncosas tan confusas!"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "Raise us properly, he said.",
      "speaker_id": 2321,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20245,
      "_bytes": 27,
      "translation": "Cuidadnos bien, dijo."
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "I'm not very confident about this.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20273,
      "_bytes": 34,
      "translation": "No tengo mucha confianza en esto."
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "I've got no confidence, nope, none\nat all. Confidence at 0 percent.",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20308,
      "_bytes": 67,
      "translation": "No tengo confianza, ninguna,\ncero. Confianza al 0 por\nciento."
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "Hey, hey!",
      "speaker_id": 2621,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20376,
      "_bytes": 9,
      "translation": "¡Eh, eh!"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "?!",
      "speaker_id": 9001,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20386,
      "_bytes": 2,
      "translation": "?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "A warship?!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20389,
      "_bytes": 11,
      "translation": "¡¿Un buque?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "No, it's a luxury liner!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20401,
      "_bytes": 24,
      "translation": "¡No, un crucero de lujo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "Why is there a luxury liner in the\nmiddle of the desert?!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20426,
      "_bytes": 57,
      "translation": "¡¿Por qué hay un crucero de\nlujo en medio del desierto?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "Aaaaaaaaaaaah!!",
      "speaker_id": 9001,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20484,
      "_bytes": 15,
      "translation": "¡¡Aaaaaaaaaaaah!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "Nume...",
      "speaker_id": 4031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20500,
      "_bytes": 7,
      "translation": "Nume..."
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "Ah! Numemon!",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20508,
      "_bytes": 12,
      "translation": "¡Ah! ¡Numemon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "Ughhh. I'm hurting.",
      "speaker_id": 2111,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20521,
      "_bytes": 19,
      "translation": "Ugh. Me duele todo."
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "Numemon! Can you let us rest on\nyour ship? Koromon's feeling weak!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20541,
      "_bytes": 66,
      "translation": "¡Numemon! ¿Nos dejáis descansar\naquí? ¡Koromon está débil!"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "Leave the Numemon to me!",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20608,
      "_bytes": 24,
      "translation": "¡Déjame a los Numemon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "?!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20633,
      "_bytes": 2,
      "translation": "?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "Numemoooon~! We're tired, so\nplease let us rest in this luxury\nliner, pleeeeease~!",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20636,
      "_bytes": 82,
      "translation": "¡Numemoooon~! ¡Estamos cansados,\ndejadnos descansar en este\ncrucero, porfaaaa~!"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "Nu!",
      "speaker_id": 4031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20719,
      "_bytes": 3,
      "translation": "¡Nu!"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "P-l-e-a-s-e!",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20723,
      "_bytes": 12,
      "translation": "¡P-o-r-f-a!"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "Numeeeeeeeeeeee!",
      "speaker_id": 4031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20736,
      "_bytes": 16,
      "translation": "¡Numeeeeeeeeeeee!"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "Whoaaaaa!",
      "speaker_id": 9001,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20753,
      "_bytes": 9,
      "translation": "¡Guaaaaa!"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "Heehee!",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20763,
      "_bytes": 7,
      "translation": "¡Jiji!"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "Waaaaah! It's like a five-star\nhotel!",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20771,
      "_bytes": 37,
      "translation": "¡Vaya! ¡Un hotel de cinco\nestrellas!"
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "How nice!",
      "speaker_id": 2521,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20809,
      "_bytes": 9,
      "translation": "¡Qué bien!"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "I'm hungry!",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20819,
      "_bytes": 11,
      "translation": "¡Qué hambre!"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "It seems there's also a dining\nroom!",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20831,
      "_bytes": 36,
      "translation": "¡Parece que también hay\nun comedor!"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "Let's go check it out!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20868,
      "_bytes": 22,
      "translation": "¡Vamos a echar un ojo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "!! It's a huge feast!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20891,
      "_bytes": 21,
      "translation": "¡Menudo banquete!"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "I...I wanna eat it.",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20913,
      "_bytes": 19,
      "translation": "Quiero comérmelo..."
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "It would be wrong to just barge in\nand eat their food!",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20933,
      "_bytes": 54,
      "translation": "¡Estaría mal entrar así\ny comernos su comida!"
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "But I *really* wanna eat it.",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 20988,
      "_bytes": 28,
      "translation": "¡Pero yo SÍ quiero comerlo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "Me too.",
      "speaker_id": 2711,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21017,
      "_bytes": 7,
      "translation": "Y yo."
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "Well, if we let the food get cold,\nit would be a disservice to the\nperson who made it.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21025,
      "_bytes": 86,
      "translation": "Bueno, si dejamos que se\nenfríe, sería una falta de\nrespeto para quien lo hizo."
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "Yeah!",
      "speaker_id": 2221,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21112,
      "_bytes": 5,
      "translation": "¡Sí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "Right on, right on!",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21118,
      "_bytes": 19,
      "translation": "¡Eso es, eso es!"
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "Let's eat!",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21138,
      "_bytes": 10,
      "translation": "¡A comer!"
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "Yeah!!",
      "speaker_id": 9001,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21149,
      "_bytes": 6,
      "translation": "¡¡Sí!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "W-what?!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21156,
      "_bytes": 8,
      "translation": "¡¿Q-qué?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "Aaaaaaagh!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21165,
      "_bytes": 10,
      "translation": "¡Aaaaaaagh!"
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "Nuuuuuuuu!!",
      "speaker_id": 4031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21176,
      "_bytes": 11,
      "translation": "¡¡Nuuuuuuu!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "Numemon! What are you doing?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21188,
      "_bytes": 28,
      "translation": "¡Numemon! ¿Qué hacéis?"
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "Don't touch Koromon!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21217,
      "_bytes": 20,
      "translation": "¡Deja a Koromon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "Taiiiiiiiii!",
      "speaker_id": 2111,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21238,
      "_bytes": 15,
      "translation": "¡Taiiiiiiiii!"
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "A-Agumon!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21254,
      "_bytes": 9,
      "translation": "¡A-Agumon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "Numemon! I'll be your opponent!",
      "speaker_id": 2121,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21264,
      "_bytes": 31,
      "translation": "¡Numemon! ¡Yo seré tu rival!"
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "All right, that's it!",
      "speaker_id": 4191,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21296,
      "_bytes": 21,
      "translation": "¡Muy bien, se acabó!"
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "Uwaaaaaaah!",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21318,
      "_bytes": 11,
      "translation": "¡Uwaaaaaaah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "You're...you're Cockatrimon!",
      "speaker_id": 2421,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21330,
      "_bytes": 28,
      "translation": "Tú... ¡tú eres Kokatorimon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "I've got a big catch today, gya!",
      "speaker_id": 4191,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21359,
      "_bytes": 32,
      "translation": "¡Hoy pesco a lo grande, gya!"
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "While we were in the\nshowers...where'd everyone go?",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21392,
      "_bytes": 51,
      "translation": "Mientras nos duchábamos...\n¿dónde está todo el mundo?"
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "!! Who's there?",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21444,
      "_bytes": 15,
      "translation": "¿Quién anda ahí?"
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "Nuuuuuuu!!",
      "speaker_id": 4031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21460,
      "_bytes": 10,
      "translation": "¡¡Nuuuuuuu!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "Kyaaaaaaaaah! Help, Palmon!",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21471,
      "_bytes": 27,
      "translation": "¡Kyaaaaaaaah! ¡Ayuda, Palmon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "It's rude to just barge in on us\nlike that! Let's go, Piyomon!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21499,
      "_bytes": 62,
      "translation": "¡Es de mala educación\nentrar así! ¡Vamos, Piyomon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "Leave it to us!",
      "speaker_id": 2321,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21562,
      "_bytes": 15,
      "translation": "¡Déjanoslo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "We'll give 'em a beating!",
      "speaker_id": 2521,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21578,
      "_bytes": 25,
      "translation": "¡Les daremos una paliza!"
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "Haaahhhh, that took way too long!",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21604,
      "_bytes": 33,
      "translation": "¡Uufff, eso ha tardado mucho!"
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "english": "The others might be in trouble,\ntoo. Come on, Mimi, let's go look\nfor them!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21638,
      "_bytes": 75,
      "translation": "Los demás también podrían\nestar en apuros. ¡Vamos, Mimi,\na buscarlos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "english": "Okaaaay!",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21714,
      "_bytes": 8,
      "translation": "¡Valeee!"
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "english": "A dining room! Someone's eaten\nhere, but...",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21723,
      "_bytes": 43,
      "translation": "¡Un comedor! Alguien ha\ncomido aquí, pero..."
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "english": "Must have been Tai and the\nothers.",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21767,
      "_bytes": 37,
      "translation": "Debieron de ser Tai y los\ndemás."
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "english": "But it doesn't look like they're\nhere anymore.",
      "speaker_id": 2521,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21805,
      "_bytes": 46,
      "translation": "Pero parece que ya no\nestán aquí."
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "english": "So they were all...",
      "speaker_id": 2321,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21852,
      "_bytes": 19,
      "translation": "Entonces todos..."
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "english": "They must've been captured. Hurry,\nlet's find them!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21872,
      "_bytes": 51,
      "translation": "Seguro que los capturaron.\n¡Rápido, busquémoslos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "english": "Now that you're here anyway, it\nsaves me some time, ga-ya!",
      "speaker_id": 4191,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21924,
      "_bytes": 58,
      "translation": "¡Ya que estáis aquí, me\nahorráis tiempo, ga-ya!"
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "english": "Cockatrimon?!",
      "speaker_id": 2521,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21983,
      "_bytes": 13,
      "translation": "¡¿Kokatorimon?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "english": "Is he working with Etemon?",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 21997,
      "_bytes": 26,
      "translation": "¿Trabaja con Etemon?"
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "english": "Seems like it.",
      "speaker_id": 2321,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22024,
      "_bytes": 14,
      "translation": "Eso parece."
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "english": "I've put the other five Chosen\nChildren out to be sun-dried,\nga-ya!",
      "speaker_id": 4191,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22039,
      "_bytes": 67,
      "translation": "¡A los otros cinco Niños\nElegidos los tengo secándose\nal sol, ga-ya!"
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "english": "They'll be sun-dried, ga-ya!",
      "speaker_id": 8021,
      "line_type": 4,
      "_offset": 22107,
      "_bytes": 28,
      "translation": "¡Se secarán al sol, ga-ya!"
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "english": "Aaah! He's got their Tags!",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22136,
      "_bytes": 26,
      "translation": "¡Aaah! ¡Tiene sus Circuitos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "english": "Aaah! He's got their Tags!",
      "speaker_id": 9901,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22163,
      "_bytes": 26,
      "translation": "¡Aaah! ¡Tiene sus Circuitos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "english": "Just a bit and I'll have 'em\ncooked nice and dry, ga-ya!",
      "speaker_id": 4191,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22190,
      "_bytes": 56,
      "translation": "¡Un poco más y los tendré\nbien secos y tostados, ga-ya!"
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "english": "How horrible...",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22247,
      "_bytes": 15,
      "translation": "Qué horror..."
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "english": "I'll be doing the same to you,\ntoo! Cocka-ka-ka-ka-ka!",
      "speaker_id": 4191,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22263,
      "_bytes": 54,
      "translation": "¡A vosotros os haré lo\nmismo! ¡Cocka-ka-ka-ka-ka!"
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "english": "We're gonna save everyone!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22318,
      "_bytes": 26,
      "translation": "¡Vamos a salvar a todos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "english": "We won't let you get away with\nthis!",
      "speaker_id": 2321,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22345,
      "_bytes": 36,
      "translation": "¡No te vas a salir con\nla tuya!"
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "english": "Let's go!",
      "speaker_id": 2521,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22382,
      "_bytes": 9,
      "translation": "¡Vamos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "english": "Take that!",
      "speaker_id": 2531,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22392,
      "_bytes": 10,
      "translation": "¡Toma esto!"
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "english": "Nngyaaaaaaaaa!",
      "speaker_id": 4191,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22403,
      "_bytes": 14,
      "translation": "¡Nngyaaaaaaaaa!"
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "english": "Sora! Mimi!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22418,
      "_bytes": 11,
      "translation": "¡Sora! ¡Mimi!"
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "english": "Tai! Everyone! I'm so glad\nyou're safe!",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22430,
      "_bytes": 42,
      "translation": "¡Tai! ¡Chicos! ¡Qué alivio\nque estéis bien!"
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "english": "Yeah, the Numemon suddenly ran\naway. W-what's that?!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22473,
      "_bytes": 52,
      "translation": "Sí, los Numemon huyeron de\nrepente. ¡¿Q-qué es eso?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "english": "Aaahhh...",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22526,
      "_bytes": 9,
      "translation": "Aaahhh..."
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "english": "It's Mimi's Crest.",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22536,
      "_bytes": 18,
      "translation": "Es el Emblema de Mimi."
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "english": "Mmmmm...",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22555,
      "_bytes": 8,
      "translation": "Mmmmm..."
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "english": "Gennai said that the Tags and\nCrests are drawn to one another.",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22564,
      "_bytes": 62,
      "translation": "Gennai dijo que los Circuitos\ny Emblemas se atraen entre sí."
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "english": "I didn't even want this. Am I even\nable to raise Palmon properly?",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22627,
      "_bytes": 65,
      "translation": "Ni siquiera lo quería. ¿Podré\ncuidar bien de Palmon?"
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "english": "M-Mimi...",
      "speaker_id": 2521,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22693,
      "_bytes": 9,
      "translation": "M-Mimi..."
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "english": "Ah, looks like we can go into this\nroom.",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22703,
      "_bytes": 40,
      "translation": "Parece que podemos entrar\nen esta sala."
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "english": "Let's check out the dining room\nfirst!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22744,
      "_bytes": 38,
      "translation": "¡Primero echemos un vistazo\nal comedor!"
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "english": "...They were all really hungry,\nweren't they?",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22783,
      "_bytes": 45,
      "translation": "...Todos tenían mucha\nhambre, ¿verdad?"
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "english": "I can't open this door, it's huge.",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22829,
      "_bytes": 34,
      "translation": "No puedo abrirla, es enorme."
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "english": "It's locked, huh? Let's go find\nthe key!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22864,
      "_bytes": 40,
      "translation": "Está cerrada. ¡Vamos a\nbuscar la llave!"
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "english": "What's this? It says \"deck key\".",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22905,
      "_bytes": 32,
      "translation": "¿Qué es esto? \"Llave de cubierta\"."
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "english": "Maybe this opens that big door!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22938,
      "_bytes": 31,
      "translation": "¡Igual abre la puerta grande!"
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "english": "Ready? I'll go in first, once we\nget the door open.",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 22970,
      "_bytes": 51,
      "translation": "¿Listos? Entro primero\nen cuanto se abra la puerta."
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "english": "I'll go in with you!",
      "speaker_id": 4294967295,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23022,
      "_bytes": 20,
      "translation": "¡Voy contigo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "english": "Be careful, Sora!",
      "speaker_id": 4294967295,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23043,
      "_bytes": 17,
      "translation": "¡Cuidado, Sora!"
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "english": "Mimi, it's dangerous!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23061,
      "_bytes": 21,
      "translation": "Mimi, ¡es peligroso!"
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "english": "I'm not letting you face danger by\nyourself!",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23083,
      "_bytes": 44,
      "translation": "¡No dejaré que afrontes el\npeligro tú sola!"
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "english": "Okay. We'll go in together!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23128,
      "_bytes": 27,
      "translation": "Vale. ¡Entraremos juntas!"
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "english": "Okay!",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23156,
      "_bytes": 5,
      "translation": "¡Vale!"
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "english": "Thanks, Mimi! Okay, I'm going in!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23162,
      "_bytes": 33,
      "translation": "¡Gracias, Mimi! ¡Voy a entrar!"
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "english": "Okay!",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23196,
      "_bytes": 5,
      "translation": "¡Vale!"
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "english": "This is a bit too convenient. It\nreminds me of when we fell into\nDevimon's trap, in that mansion.",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23202,
      "_bytes": 97,
      "translation": "Esto es demasiado oportuno.\nMe recuerda a cuando caímos\nen la trampa de Devimon."
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "english": "You're overthinking it, aren't you?",
      "speaker_id": 4294967295,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23300,
      "_bytes": 35,
      "translation": "Le estás dando muchas vueltas, ¿no?"
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "english": "We gotta be careful around Numemon.",
      "speaker_id": 4294967295,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23336,
      "_bytes": 35,
      "translation": "Cuidado con los Numemon."
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "english": "Maybe. Maybe I'm just tired.",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23372,
      "_bytes": 28,
      "translation": "Puede. Quizá solo esté cansado."
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "english": "You should get some rest!",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23401,
      "_bytes": 25,
      "translation": "¡Deberías descansar!"
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "english": "Yeah, that's a good idea. I'll\ntalk to the others about it, too.",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23427,
      "_bytes": 64,
      "translation": "Sí, buena idea. Se lo diré\ntambién a los demás."
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "english": "Okaaaaaaay!",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23492,
      "_bytes": 11,
      "translation": "¡Vaaaaaale!"
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "english": "But you know, I'm starving...",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23504,
      "_bytes": 29,
      "translation": "Aunque... me muero de hambre."
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "english": "Mimi, you shouldn't have been so\nforward to those Numemon.",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23534,
      "_bytes": 58,
      "translation": "Mimi, no deberías haber\nsido tan atrevida con esos\nNumemon."
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "english": "But they let us on the ship.",
      "speaker_id": 4294967295,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23593,
      "_bytes": 28,
      "translation": "Pero nos dejaron subir."
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "english": "We're safe if we're together, Sora!",
      "speaker_id": 4294967295,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23622,
      "_bytes": 35,
      "translation": "¡Juntas estamos a salvo, Sora!"
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "english": "They must be plotting something.\nIt's strange for Numemon to be\nliving in a luxury liner.",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23658,
      "_bytes": 89,
      "translation": "Deben de estar tramando algo.\nEs raro que los Numemon vivan\nen un crucero de lujo."
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "english": "Really?",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23748,
      "_bytes": 7,
      "translation": "Ah ¿sí?"
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "english": "Yeah, let's stick together as best\nas we can.",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23756,
      "_bytes": 45,
      "translation": "Sí, mantengámonos juntas\ntodo lo posible."
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "english": "Thanks, Sora!",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23802,
      "_bytes": 13,
      "translation": "¡Gracias, Sora!"
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "english": "I hope this isn't one of Etemon's\ntraps, but...",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23816,
      "_bytes": 47,
      "translation": "Espero que no sea una\ntrampa de Etemon, pero..."
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "english": "If we don't figure out what Gennai\nmeant about raising them\nproperly...",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23864,
      "_bytes": 71,
      "translation": "Si no averiguamos qué quiso\ndecir Gennai con eso de\ncuidarlos bien..."
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "english": "Are you thinking about something,\nIzzy?",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23936,
      "_bytes": 44,
      "translation": "¿Estás pensando en algo,\nIzzy?"
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "english": "Yes, I was just thinking about the\nfuture, since we don't know enough\nabout the Crests.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 23981,
      "_bytes": 87,
      "translation": "Sí, pensaba en el futuro,\nya que no sabemos mucho\nsobre los Emblemas."
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "english": "We don't need those Crests.",
      "speaker_id": 4294967295,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24069,
      "_bytes": 27,
      "translation": "No necesitamos Emblemas."
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "english": "Just what I expected, Izzy!",
      "speaker_id": 4294967295,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24097,
      "_bytes": 32,
      "translation": "¡Era de esperar, Izzy!"
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "english": "No, we can't possibly fight\nwithout the Crests. We have to\nlearn to utilize them properly.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24130,
      "_bytes": 90,
      "translation": "No, no podemos luchar sin\nlos Emblemas. Debemos aprender\na usarlos bien."
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "english": "But I don't want Palmon to end up\nevolving like Agumon!",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24221,
      "_bytes": 55,
      "translation": "¡Pero no quiero que Palmon\nevolucione mal como Agumon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "english": "I see what you mean, but...",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24277,
      "_bytes": 27,
      "translation": "Te entiendo, pero..."
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "english": "No, Tai's been working at this\nmuch harder than I have.",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24305,
      "_bytes": 58,
      "translation": "No, Tai se lo ha currado\nmucho más que yo."
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "english": "Really? I think you've been\nspending a lot of time thinking\nabout this, Izzy.",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24364,
      "_bytes": 82,
      "translation": "¿En serio? Yo creo que has\npasado mucho tiempo pensando\nen esto, Izzy."
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "english": "You're embarrassing me...",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24447,
      "_bytes": 25,
      "translation": "Me estás avergonzando..."
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "english": "\"Raise properly\"...*muttering*",
      "speaker_id": 1041,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24473,
      "_bytes": 30,
      "translation": "\"Cuidarlos bien\"... (murmura)"
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "english": "You were amazing back there, Mimi!\nI heard what you said to the\nNumemon!",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24504,
      "_bytes": 72,
      "translation": "¡Has estado genial, Mimi!\n¡He oído lo que les dijiste\na los Numemon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "english": "You can't beat my natural charm!",
      "speaker_id": 4294967295,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24577,
      "_bytes": 32,
      "translation": "¡Nadie supera mi encanto natural!"
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "english": "I doubt you could do it, T.K.",
      "speaker_id": 4294967295,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24610,
      "_bytes": 32,
      "translation": "Dudo que tú pudieras, T.K."
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "english": "Seems like you're the Numemon\nprincess!",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24643,
      "_bytes": 39,
      "translation": "¡Eres la princesa de los\nNumemon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "english": "Yuck. I don't want to be *that*\nkind of princess...",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24683,
      "_bytes": 51,
      "translation": "Puaj. No quiero ser ESE\ntipo de princesa..."
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "english": "Hmph! Even I could do that, if\nit's just a Numemon henchman!",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24735,
      "_bytes": 60,
      "translation": "¡Hmph! ¡Hasta yo podría, si\nsolo es un esbirro Numemon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "english": "You're so cute when you get\nirritated!",
      "speaker_id": 1061,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24796,
      "_bytes": 38,
      "translation": "¡Estás monísima cuando\nte enfadas!"
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "english": "Awwww! You're mean, Mimi!",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24835,
      "_bytes": 25,
      "translation": "¡Ains! ¡Qué mala eres, Mimi!"
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "english": "There are a lot of different\nNumemon, huh.",
      "speaker_id": 1071,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24861,
      "_bytes": 42,
      "translation": "Hay muchos tipos distintos\nde Numemon, ¿eh?"
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "english": "I wanna take a shower soon!",
      "speaker_id": 4294967295,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24904,
      "_bytes": 27,
      "translation": "¡Quiero ducharme ya!"
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "english": "I'll talk with everyone a bit more.",
      "speaker_id": 4294967295,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 24932,
      "_bytes": 35,
      "translation": "Hablaré un poco más con todos."
    }
  ]
}